# Project-Specific
# ====================
# Logs directory (if you create one)
logs/
# NOTE: removed blanket "data/" rule - it was matching source folders
# named Data/ (Configuration/Data, Ticket/Data, Streams/Data) on Windows
# due to case-insensitive git matching, silently excluding real source
# code from every commit. The runtime SQLite files are already covered
# by the *.db / *.db-shm / *.db-wal rules above, so this line was both
# redundant and actively harmful.
# Migration backups
Migrations/backup/
# Firebase / Google service account keys - never commit
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json
